WEBVTT

01:35.370 --> 01:37.710
Naeka-senpai!

01:37.710 --> 01:39.250
Do your best!

01:39.830 --> 01:42.540
A match of three, no time-outs.

01:42.540 --> 01:45.760
If the Girl's club wins, you will have to do as promised.

01:46.510 --> 01:47.970
Sure.

01:47.970 --> 01:51.970
If you win, we will let the Girl's club claim the newly constructed kendo dojo.

01:52.640 --> 01:56.730
But, if the Boy's club wins...

01:56.730 --> 01:58.020
Then?

02:00.020 --> 02:01.860
Fujiwara Naeka!

02:02.980 --> 02:04.020
Your...

02:04.020 --> 02:05.320
Pair of tits!

02:06.070 --> 02:09.860
Let us grope them as much as we want!

02:12.910 --> 02:16.080
That also means, skin to skin!

02:18.410 --> 02:22.170
President, please let me use my sword.

02:22.170 --> 02:23.290
Approved.

02:23.290 --> 02:24.880
Cut them up as much as you want.

02:32.220 --> 02:33.850
St...stop!

02:33.850 --> 02:35.100
Wait, Fujiwara!

02:35.100 --> 02:37.560
I'm sorry, it was a joke! It was just a joke!

02:37.560 --> 02:39.100
You don't need to explain.

02:39.100 --> 02:40.480
Tenge!

02:43.480 --> 02:47.940
Master is very lively today, that's good.

02:47.940 --> 02:48.860
Huh?

02:52.240 --> 02:53.740
Stare.

02:53.740 --> 02:56.120
Maid Guy's sensor has detected staring.

02:56.620 --> 03:00.620
Besides me, there's someone else staring at Master passionately.

03:02.250 --> 03:05.130
Such passionate staring...

03:05.790 --> 03:07.920
Damn.

03:07.920 --> 03:09.840
Who is this person?

03:11.190 --> 03:14.860
Don't Stop the Romance?

03:11.270 --> 03:14.860
Service Three

03:17.760 --> 03:19.930
Didn't you go a bit overboard?

03:19.930 --> 03:23.600
They were so scared, even though you only used the back of the blade.

03:23.600 --> 03:27.110
They are failures as swordsmen. Dying is too good for them.

03:27.610 --> 03:32.570
Why are the guys around me such perverted idiots?

03:32.570 --> 03:37.700
To achieve victory, they should swear to not be perverted. Why can't they get that.

03:37.700 --> 03:40.540
Are guys like that even worth it?

03:40.540 --> 03:42.000
Anyways, Naeka...

03:42.370 --> 03:45.210
Simply put, you just hate men.

03:45.210 --> 03:47.380
Is it because you're not interested in love?

03:47.380 --> 03:52.630
For someone walking the path of the sword, love is just wild flowers on the pavement.

03:59.680 --> 04:00.890
That was...

04:08.610 --> 04:10.070
Just as I thought.

04:16.160 --> 04:17.490
Naeka?

04:19.280 --> 04:20.370
What's that thing?

04:25.080 --> 04:26.210
A dog?

04:26.210 --> 04:28.590
What about that dog?

04:28.590 --> 04:30.800
Um.... Yeah...

04:30.800 --> 04:33.010
Is it a rare species?

04:34.590 --> 04:36.340
It might be.

04:36.970 --> 04:39.720
Tell me the details later.

04:39.720 --> 04:41.390
Tell you what?

04:54.030 --> 04:55.820
A love letter.

04:56.490 --> 05:00.370
There's no mistake. This is... a love letter.

05:01.120 --> 05:02.450
Anyways, Naeka...

05:02.450 --> 05:04.870
Simply put, you just hate men.

05:04.870 --> 05:06.790
Is it because you're not interested in love?

05:20.600 --> 05:24.140
I can never...love again.

05:24.140 --> 05:26.440
I decided on that day.

05:27.310 --> 05:28.480
I'm sorry.

05:28.480 --> 05:33.610
To a person who's walking the path of the sword, love is just a mirage.

05:33.610 --> 05:36.150
This will just only confuse me on my path.

05:40.320 --> 05:42.740
You have to give up on love, Naeka!

05:46.040 --> 05:48.460
But, maybe I should wait a bit.

05:48.750 --> 05:51.960
A warrior's benevolence... Maybe I should just take a peek.

05:52.170 --> 05:53.300
Master.

05:53.840 --> 05:57.170
I have something to tell you about this letter.

06:00.930 --> 06:02.010
Naeka-sama!

06:02.010 --> 06:03.560
Nee-chan?

06:04.100 --> 06:06.350
What happened?

06:06.350 --> 06:10.600
After a sharp scream, she ran out.

06:10.600 --> 06:13.230
Then she ran into the wall and exploded.

06:14.150 --> 06:15.440
That is...

06:16.070 --> 06:17.320
It can't be.

06:17.320 --> 06:18.780
A love letter?

06:19.950 --> 06:22.530
You say there's no problem with it?

06:23.780 --> 06:26.500
Yes, about receiving a love letter.

06:26.500 --> 06:30.420
It isn't uncommon at Naeka-sama's age.

06:30.420 --> 06:32.500
It might be a trap.

06:32.500 --> 06:35.840
The danger level around Naeka-sama is green... It's very safe.

06:35.840 --> 06:41.010
I'm sure that it has nothing to do with any enemies.

06:42.930 --> 06:44.260
Okay, then.

06:44.260 --> 06:49.730
I will witness all of Master's relationship from the beginning to the end.

06:50.440 --> 06:53.150
This needs to be returned to Naeka-sama.

06:53.150 --> 06:56.190
Listen, our mission is

06:56.190 --> 06:57.650
not to interfere with Naeka-sama's personal life.

06:58.030 --> 07:01.410
Maid Guy's X-ray Vision.

07:01.410 --> 07:04.120
We cannot forget our mission as maids.

07:04.120 --> 07:07.490
{While Above} Tomorrow after school, behind the gym...

07:05.700 --> 07:07.490
You have to listen properly!

07:11.500 --> 07:16.250
I'm ordering you not to interfere with Naeka-sama's school life.

07:16.250 --> 07:17.920
Do you understand?

07:17.920 --> 07:19.590
This won't work.

07:20.010 --> 07:22.970
Nee-chan has Philophobia.

07:22.970 --> 07:24.930
Philophobia?

07:25.600 --> 07:29.980
Nee-chan once believed in her fate.

07:29.980 --> 07:33.310
Someone that was loyal to the one she liked, a girl who always dreamed of the best ending.

07:34.230 --> 07:38.150
Until that terrible event happened...

07:38.610 --> 07:40.860
Senpai! Senpai!

07:43.860 --> 07:46.160
You're... that... from the first grade...

07:46.160 --> 07:47.330
I'm Fujiwara.

07:47.330 --> 07:49.830
Fujiwara Naeka from the first grade of middle school.

07:50.160 --> 07:54.250
I'm sorry, I'm not good with names.

07:54.250 --> 07:55.500
Senpai...

07:55.500 --> 07:59.840
Does that mean you've also forgotten the letter that I wrote to you before?

08:00.670 --> 08:01.920
Before?

08:02.590 --> 08:06.260
I'd written a lot of letters, and finally gave one to you.

08:06.260 --> 08:09.680
Uh, no... that... that...

08:10.810 --> 08:14.900
Um, I made a bento today.

08:18.190 --> 08:20.940
Fujiwara, what about your lunch?

08:22.530 --> 08:25.030
If you haven't eaten yet, let's eat together.

08:27.660 --> 08:28.910
Okay!

08:31.490 --> 08:35.750
Um... I've never really cooked before.

08:35.750 --> 08:38.250
Please tell me if it's no good.

08:39.090 --> 08:43.970
How can something that took a lot of effort, not be good?

08:46.090 --> 08:47.220
Senpai...!

08:47.640 --> 08:49.850
SENPAI!

08:50.850 --> 08:55.100
That senpai transferred out due to fear of Nee-chan's attempted poisoning.

08:55.770 --> 08:59.230
Nee-chan suffered a huge shock, thus getting Philophobia.

08:59.230 --> 09:03.650
Her maiden's heart of love has been sealed ever since.

09:03.650 --> 09:05.570
That's depressing...

09:10.240 --> 09:12.910
I'm sorry! I'm sorry, senpai!

09:12.910 --> 09:14.290
No!

09:14.620 --> 09:19.080
Don't call me "Poison Woman!"

09:20.840 --> 09:22.880
Oh, it's just a dream.

09:25.880 --> 09:26.760
Hello.

09:27.090 --> 09:30.470
Now, tell me who sent that love letter!

09:31.140 --> 09:33.970
Tell you what? I haven't even read it myself.

09:33.970 --> 09:35.140
Haven't read it?

09:35.140 --> 09:37.770
That's such a waste. Why don't you just read it?

09:38.310 --> 09:41.400
I'm not interested. I'm just going to throw it away.

09:41.400 --> 09:41.980
See ya.

09:41.980 --> 09:43.690
Hey, Naeka!

09:45.190 --> 09:46.400
That's right.

09:46.400 --> 09:50.450
To a person who's walking the path of the sword, a love letter is nothing.

09:51.830 --> 09:53.490
Where did I put it?

09:54.240 --> 09:58.160
Master, are you looking for this?

09:58.160 --> 09:59.290
Give me that back! That's...

10:01.540 --> 10:04.170
I was planning to throw it away.

10:04.170 --> 10:05.760
Then give it to me.

10:06.920 --> 10:08.800
Maid Guy Shredder!

10:10.010 --> 10:11.800
No!

10:14.010 --> 10:17.850
You wanted it back so badly...
It proves you still have feelings for it.

10:17.850 --> 10:21.350
Your faith in love has not yet fully disappeared.

10:21.350 --> 10:23.320
Don't jump to your own conclusions.

10:23.320 --> 10:27.030
To a person who's walking the path of the sword, love is useless.

10:27.030 --> 10:30.450
Then, what's this?

10:34.780 --> 10:38.870
Amazing, there's a pile of romance manga and novels.

10:38.870 --> 10:40.000
Kousuke!

10:40.000 --> 10:41.580
No! Don't look!

10:41.580 --> 10:45.420
You really know where she hides things, Kogarashi-san.

10:46.250 --> 10:49.470
Who do you think cleans everyday?

10:50.090 --> 10:52.430
"Love Guidance For Today"

10:52.430 --> 10:54.970
"Tell Me, The True and False of Love"

10:54.970 --> 10:59.680
"Absolute Walk through: The Correct Café For Dating"

11:00.850 --> 11:04.020
You don't even have someone you like, and you're already preparing a date plan.

11:04.810 --> 11:07.980
You're an impressive master.

11:07.980 --> 11:10.320
Stop it, idiot!

11:10.320 --> 11:11.530
Kogarashi-san!

11:13.070 --> 11:14.870
Let me make it clear.

11:14.870 --> 11:19.450
Our mission is to serve our masters without having to interfere with their lives.

11:19.450 --> 11:21.250
What are you talking about?

11:21.500 --> 11:26.670
Isn't protecting Master's bloodline also our mission?

11:26.750 --> 11:28.800
Even if you say that...

11:28.800 --> 11:29.880
What are you saying?

11:29.880 --> 11:33.720
If this continues, Master will just be a homeless dog.

11:34.140 --> 11:37.810
You've only suffered being lovelorn once,
but you still haven't got past this obstacle.

11:37.810 --> 11:40.770
And you're talking about walking the path of the sword... Stop joking around!

11:42.230 --> 11:44.810
Kogarashi-san, you're tone...

11:44.810 --> 11:48.270
Exactly! Do you understand how painful it is to be lovelorn?

11:48.570 --> 11:51.780
Every time I get a bad ending, I soak my pillow with tears.

11:51.720 --> 11:54.460
m 120 100 l 500 100 500 200 120 200

11:51.720 --> 11:54.460
I'm sorry, Kousuke.  
I already have someone I like.

11:52.150 --> 11:53.910
I'm sorry, Kousuke-kun.

11:56.570 --> 11:57.740
Dammit.

11:58.080 --> 12:00.040
Master is a homeless dog.

12:00.160 --> 12:03.120
Her brother only knows how to play eroges.

12:03.120 --> 12:06.000
What glasses types, sister types, cat ear types?!

12:07.920 --> 12:11.260
You're a bunch of sad grandchildren!

12:11.260 --> 12:12.840
You even included me...

12:14.930 --> 12:17.140
Don't worry, Master.

12:17.640 --> 12:21.850
I understand that you're not good with love, which is why you feel so down.

12:21.850 --> 12:27.310
But, as long as I'm here, I will serve you until happiness.

12:27.400 --> 12:30.570
That's me, Maid Guy.

12:33.400 --> 12:36.030
This is Maid Guy's special drink.

12:36.030 --> 12:36.740
Drink it.

12:36.740 --> 12:39.030
I'm not going to drink something so suspicious.

12:39.030 --> 12:41.490
But, there are zero calories.

12:41.490 --> 12:42.750
Seriously?

13:07.200 --> 13:08.540
Hold me?

13:08.860 --> 13:10.510
Hey... hold me?

13:10.560 --> 13:12.940
What did you say, Naeka-sama?

13:12.940 --> 13:15.200
Kogarashi-san, what did you give her?!

13:15.200 --> 13:20.450
A stimulant that makes your heart desire love.

13:20.450 --> 13:22.700
Is it too effective for Master?

13:22.700 --> 13:24.660
What did you say?

13:26.210 --> 13:29.080
Maid-san yuri... I'm totally okay with this.

13:29.080 --> 13:30.210
Can I film this?

13:30.590 --> 13:32.960
Don't say that! Help me!

13:33.630 --> 13:36.260
Kogarashi-san, what should I do?

13:36.260 --> 13:38.430
Don't worry, do it more.

13:38.430 --> 13:40.800
I'm going out now. I'll give you an hour.

13:41.140 --> 13:43.390
Kogarashi-san!

13:50.060 --> 13:54.860
Are you living well today? My beloved grandchildren...

13:57.530 --> 14:00.490
I said I'm not going to film it, but at least let me see!

14:06.000 --> 14:13.000
Wh...Wh...Wh...Wh...Wh...Wh...Wh...

14:13.000 --> 14:17.470
Wh... What has happened to you?

14:32.110 --> 14:34.730
We should've done this from the beginning.

14:34.730 --> 14:36.940
Here, Naeka-sama.

14:37.900 --> 14:40.700
These are... ingredients for deep fried shrimp.

14:41.320 --> 14:42.700
It won't work.

14:42.700 --> 14:45.830
I've received the title of "Poison Woman" from making deep fried shrimp.

14:45.830 --> 14:48.450
I will teach you.

14:48.450 --> 14:53.790
If this works, I'm sure you can forget that painful memory.

14:54.540 --> 14:58.010
Fukibi-san... Thank you!

14:58.380 --> 15:00.720
You'll have to remove the skin from the shrimp.

15:00.720 --> 15:02.300
Argh, I used too much strength.

15:02.300 --> 15:06.600
Wait! The egg before the wheat flour and the flour is last!

15:06.600 --> 15:09.180
This tastes weird... The oil is bad.

15:09.180 --> 15:12.060
That's vinegar, the oil is here!

15:12.060 --> 15:14.980
I'm going to put it in... Ready...

15:38.760 --> 15:39.670
Eat it.

15:39.670 --> 15:40.800
Me?

15:40.800 --> 15:42.680
This is...

15:42.680 --> 15:44.050
Kousuke-sama.

15:44.050 --> 15:46.430
It's courtesy to eat food that a girl has made.

15:46.850 --> 15:49.180
This is...the fate of men.

15:49.180 --> 15:50.140
Here.

15:57.940 --> 15:58.820
How is it?

16:03.910 --> 16:06.280
This is food! This is food made for humans!

16:06.910 --> 16:10.040
It tastes just like fried shrimp!

16:11.450 --> 16:12.960
Yay!

16:12.960 --> 16:15.330
Congratulations, Naeka-sama!

16:15.330 --> 16:17.750
Thank god, nee-chan!

16:24.760 --> 16:26.010
It will be alright.

16:26.010 --> 16:29.560
I can love again.

16:29.560 --> 16:33.060
Because I've extracted that painful memory.

16:38.440 --> 16:41.070
Nice to meet you, Fujiwara Naeka-sama.

16:41.610 --> 16:43.860
I've always noticed you.

16:44.950 --> 16:46.450
Oh my god.

16:47.700 --> 16:52.540
To... to send these feelings to you, I wrote this letter.

16:52.540 --> 16:55.210
No.  I'm not mentally prepared yet.

16:55.210 --> 16:57.210
Wait... Wait..

16:57.790 --> 17:01.380
Tomorrow after school, I'll meet you behind the gym.

17:01.380 --> 17:04.260
Yay.

17:14.310 --> 17:16.480
Thank you for coming.

17:17.310 --> 17:20.190
I've always noticed you.

17:22.780 --> 17:23.400
Oh...

17:24.030 --> 17:25.280
I love you.

17:25.280 --> 17:27.410
Will you go out with me?

17:29.120 --> 17:31.370
I'll make you a bento...

17:32.290 --> 17:33.830
What do you like to eat?

17:35.330 --> 17:37.580
The second question, Fujiwara.

17:37.580 --> 17:39.580
The second question?

17:40.000 --> 17:42.590
Huh? Second question?

17:44.550 --> 17:46.800
Page 192, question 2.

17:46.800 --> 17:48.050
What about the bento?

17:48.050 --> 17:51.390
Lunch is after this period, idiot.

17:52.890 --> 17:54.060
Fujiwara, question 2.

17:55.430 --> 17:56.680
Fujiwara!

18:00.150 --> 18:02.070
You can't stop the romance?

18:02.070 --> 18:05.110
Yeah, my brain is filled with pink.

18:05.570 --> 18:09.160
It's just a love letter and she's already filled with happiness.

18:09.160 --> 18:14.450
This is my exploding feelings after that event.

18:14.450 --> 18:16.290
Ah. This is love...

18:16.290 --> 18:18.290
Love? Aren't you rushing it?

18:18.290 --> 18:21.670
You don't even know who it is.

18:23.290 --> 18:24.420
That's right!

18:24.420 --> 18:25.380
Wait!

18:25.380 --> 18:26.960
Don't tell me that you've never considered that.

18:27.340 --> 18:29.510
What if he's not my type?!

18:29.510 --> 18:32.260
What if he's big and overweight?

18:32.260 --> 18:34.220
Over thinking has a limit too!

18:34.220 --> 18:37.020
It doesn't even show a name!

18:37.020 --> 18:38.940
Then don't go!

18:38.940 --> 18:39.730
That's impossible.

18:39.730 --> 18:45.820
No matter what, he is the destined one that changed me, who had forgotten how to love.

18:45.820 --> 18:47.940
You're not living for the sword anymore?

18:48.490 --> 18:52.570
Honestly, love is the essence of life.

18:52.570 --> 18:55.870
I was so stupid before.

18:55.870 --> 18:58.290
Goodbye, me from yesterday!

18:58.290 --> 19:02.420
Hello, today's me!

19:03.250 --> 19:05.170
She's pissing me off.

19:05.170 --> 19:06.420
Ignore her.

19:08.510 --> 19:09.920
Perfect.

19:09.920 --> 19:15.140
But this master... I don't know when she will back away.

19:15.720 --> 19:19.350
If you're going to bloom, bloom the flower of love beautifully.

19:19.350 --> 19:23.400
I will help my master's relationship from beginning till end.

19:23.770 --> 19:27.110
This is me, Maid Guy!

19:27.780 --> 19:30.780
What will he be? What will he be?

19:31.320 --> 19:33.820
If I don't worry about the body.

19:34.160 --> 19:38.910
Even if it's the fatty type, as long as he's beautiful from the inside, the inside.

19:38.910 --> 19:43.370
Of course, if he's the perfect type I will be overjoyed.

19:43.370 --> 19:45.330
Let's both of us go to the beach.

19:45.330 --> 19:48.340
I will make you a bento.

19:50.460 --> 19:53.380
I really want to see the ocean with you.

19:53.380 --> 19:55.430
I've always wanted it like that.

19:57.100 --> 20:01.060
Yes, and then, both of us... at the beach under the night sky...

20:02.560 --> 20:06.980
That's too early! No. We can't do that yet...

20:06.110 --> 20:06.900
Fujiwara-senpai.

20:16.990 --> 20:21.330
After coming back to my senses, I didn't know when I had arrived at the back of the gym.

20:21.330 --> 20:25.630
Then I looked, there was a girl standing there.

20:26.670 --> 20:28.250
Who are you?

20:28.250 --> 20:30.460
To think that you actually came!

20:31.420 --> 20:35.130
That means it was right to gather myself and send you that letter.

20:35.800 --> 20:37.680
The suspect is actually you?!

20:38.430 --> 20:42.230
At a kendo competition before... after seeing senpai's performance...

20:42.850 --> 20:44.980
I...

20:44.980 --> 20:46.520
To senpai...

20:46.520 --> 20:47.480
Dash!

20:48.810 --> 20:51.110
Master, where are you going?

20:52.190 --> 20:53.280
Kogarashi-san!

20:53.280 --> 20:57.370
This will only work out for people who look and strive forward.

20:57.370 --> 20:59.870
That is happiness!

21:05.460 --> 21:09.840
If this weak master wants to hide,

21:09.840 --> 21:15.680
I will destroy that path. That is Maid Guy's duty.

21:16.380 --> 21:18.090
Ouch.

21:19.640 --> 21:22.180
Wh... What is this place?

21:25.180 --> 21:27.230
Th...Th...Th...Th...

21:27.230 --> 21:28.690
Senpai! Senpai!

21:28.690 --> 21:32.020
There's this really royal bed there.

21:32.150 --> 21:34.240
I've predicted this.

21:34.240 --> 21:37.780
I've already prepared the sweet room for you.

21:37.780 --> 21:42.830
This will leave only one path for the scared master.

21:42.830 --> 21:44.290
Don't force me to move forward!

21:44.290 --> 21:45.580
Look at the situation!

21:45.580 --> 21:48.250
It's a sudden development that it's actually a girl!

21:48.250 --> 21:50.210
Get me out of here now!

21:50.210 --> 21:54.840
Don't worry, I'm fine with whatever Master thinks.

21:55.340 --> 21:57.220
Listen to me!

21:57.220 --> 22:01.050
I'm out... Take your time, Master.

21:58.970 --> 22:01.050
Wait!

22:01.050 --> 22:04.470
What do you want me to do here, idiot!

22:05.100 --> 22:07.060
What are you talking about, senpai?

22:07.440 --> 22:10.270
Do you really need to ask?

22:19.240 --> 22:24.040
What kind of joke is this!

22:28.040 --> 22:30.000
Oh, Nee-san. You're back...

22:30.460 --> 22:32.040
Where is he?

22:32.040 --> 22:34.090
Nee-san, what are you doing?

22:33.880 --> 22:34.960
Where is he?

22:41.640 --> 22:44.000
Nee-san, don't use your sword! The sword!

22:41.820 --> 22:50.810
Fu

22:42.030 --> 22:50.810
ji

22:42.240 --> 22:50.810
wara

22:42.450 --> 22:50.810
Na

22:42.660 --> 22:50.810
e

22:42.860 --> 22:50.810
ka,

22:43.320 --> 22:50.810
